242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (The simulation demonstrated the robot's ability to move and detect the terrain or map provided. Future work will focus on enhancing the map with real-world conditions and integrating additional features into the robot to improve navigation and detection capabilities in actual scenarios and learing more about )
/Pg 21 0 R
