245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (If we have several more weeks, the focus will be on improving the simulation in Gazebo to make it more realistic, including adding terrains like rubble and uneven surfaces. This will help the robot better adapt to disaster conditions. Alongside this, the team will research related robotics topics, such as behavior trees and sensor integration, while connecting with experts to gain more insights.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
