/P 117 0 R
/E (Although the current plan is ambitious, the team aims to align it with practical, existing technologies by focusing on achievable tasks, efforts will be directed at enhancing the simulation map. After that, the focus will shift to learning from academic papers and expert feedback to refine the project step by step.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
